{"games":[{"id":71360925634781,"name":"[💸] My Brainrot Egg Farm","desc":"🧠 Welcome to Brainrot Egg Factory!\n\n💤 EGGS GROW AND MONEY STACKS WHILE YOU SLEEP! 🤑\n\n🥚 Hatch — Open eggs to get Brainrots, from common to super rare!\n🤝 Upgrade — Upgrade Brainrots to get even more Money!\n💸 Earn — Get better Brainrots to make more money and climb the leaderboard.\n🌟 Mutations — Some Brainrots have special forms that are worth more!\n\n💻 Play Anywhere — Works on PC, Mobile, Tablet & Console. Full Controller Support!\n\n⚠️ Join our community to trade more! Only trade using the in-game trade system.","path":"/game/71360925634781-my-brainrot-egg-farm","slug":"71360925634781-my-brainrot-egg-farm","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/05905ee37cb81a51001638d3218fcd3dafd3abcbc6af7194c0be132c337a8646.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3daa5530db1955579f3bbde7dfac07c9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":83300575,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-30T14:47:18.581Z","creator":{"name":"BeF BeF BeF","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17487086188,"name":"void fishing [QUESTS]","desc":"this abyss is ripe with loot, son.\nevery time a game is closed, or a world is ended, or an object goes just a little too fast, it might end up here - in the void, waiting to be salvaged.\n\njoin the group for autofish!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/8019744/wunmo#!/about\n\n🌌 FEATURES \ncatch loot — every cast is a catch!\nset sail - find islands in an infinite void world!\nopen troves — the voidfishers of the past loved to keep their treasures in troves, that now float and wait to be caught.\ncomplete quests — some customers put in special orders. get great rewards for completing them!\ncatalog the void — over 230 different items to collect and log\nuncover the secrets — what hides in the abyss?\n\nSpecial thanks to the extremely talented:\nCeronoid\nPhotonic (@imma1humanbeing)\nBlog (@LuhvBlog)\nZerro (@sokzerro)\n